00:25:07.240 --> 00:25:09.750
Sellest ei taha mõeldagi.

360
00:25:09.850 --> 00:25:14.590
Tookord noorlendur lennulüli juht
Hendrik Arro meenutab seda

361
00:25:14.619 --> 00:25:17.830
